      "description": "Check a doctor's or a department's availability for today or an explicit date. Resolves the doctor or department from the hospital directory (asking for a choice when several match), then returns the usual hours qualified by the live board for each session: IN, LATE (with expected time), CANCELLED, NOT_CONFIRMED or UNKNOWN. UNKNOWN returns CALLBACK_REQUIRED: collect name and callback number only.",
